## Golden Test：像素级 UI 回归测试

Golden Test 将 Widget 渲染为图像并与「黄金标准」截图比对，防止意外的 UI 变化：

```dart
// test/presentation/widgets/product_card_golden_test.dart
void main() {
  testWidgets('ProductCard golden test', (tester) async {
    await tester.pumpWidget(
      MaterialApp(
        theme: AppTheme.light,
        home: Scaffold(
          body: Center(
            child: SizedBox(
              width: 300,
              child: ProductCard(product: testProduct),
            ),
          ),
        ),
      ),
    );

    await expectLater(
      find.byType(ProductCard),
      matchesGoldenFile('goldens/product_card.png'),
    );
  });
}
```

**更新黄金文件**：

```bash
# 首次生成或需要更新时
flutter test --update-goldens test/presentation/widgets/product_card_golden_test.dart
```

### 使用 golden_toolkit 提升 Golden Test 能力

`golden_toolkit` 提供多屏幕尺寸、暗色/亮色主题的批量截图：

```dart
void main() {
  testGoldens('ProductCard in multiple sizes', (tester) async {
    await tester.pumpWidgetBuilder(
      ProductCard(product: testProduct),
      wrapper: materialAppWrapper(theme: ThemeData.light()),
    );

    await multiScreenGolden(tester, 'product_card');
  });
}
```

